Subject: [PATCH] W1-02 BlockPos: stage churn benchmark

Stage 1 of W1-02 (BlockPos). Quantifies fresh-allocation vs scoped
mutable-reuse for BlockPos-shaped coordinates using isomorphic stand-in
structs, so the pattern's GC cost transfers 1:1 to future NMS call-site
edits. Per P1.md discipline each stage benchmarks independently.
